      en: ["Bissen is part of the Canton of Mersch and has a population of around 3,400.", "The ArcelorMittal plant in Bissen specializes in the production of steel wire products.", "The commune is situated on the Attert River, a tributary of the Alzette.", "The parish church of Saint-Étienne is a designated national cultural monument.", "Bissen is conveniently linked to Luxembourg City via the A7 motorway.", "The town’s industrial history dates back to the 19th century with early ironworks."],
